{"displayStem":"같은 작은창자 조직을 서로 다른 관찰 규모로 단순화한 독립 모식도이다. 가·나의 연결선은 관찰 부위를 나타낸다. 실제 현미경사진이나 길이 측정 도판은 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 가상 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"독립 제작 구조 모식도\"><rect width=\"620\" height=\"360\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR, sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"25\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"22\">가 · 점막 돌출</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"22\">나 · 가의 표면 세포</text><path d=\"M70 290V180Q70 70 150 70Q230 70 230 180V290\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M95 290V180Q95 100 150 100Q205 100 205 180V290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></path><text x=\"108\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"18\">고유판</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"20\">바깥 한 층: 상피</text><rect x=\"385\" y=\"120\" width=\"150\" height=\"160\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><ellipse cx=\"460\" cy=\"230\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"14\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><path d=\"M395 120L395 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M409 120L409 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M423 120L423 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M437 120L437 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M451 120L451 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M465 120L465 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M479 120L479 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M493 120L493 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M507 120L507 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M521 120L521 72\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"375\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"20\">한 세포의 꼭대기면</text><path d=\"M244 165L350 165\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"></path></g></svg></div></div>"]}